# The plate set the real plate path is measured on (TestRealPlates;
# ASSUMPTIONS VIS-A33): the first 500 rows of the first shard of
# spawn99/UK-Car-Plate-VRN-Dataset on Hugging Face (MIT), synthetic UK
# plates rendered from random registrations, each clean and twice
# augmented (blurred, tilted, noised on a 448-pixel background): plates of
# no real vehicle. .github/workflows/vision-real.yml fetches it at a fixed
# revision, unpacks it with pyarrow pinned by its wheels' hashes, and never
# commits it. Each line: name, value.
